 "purpose": "Attach the D4 Magichange attacks the importer dropped to the five imported monsters that learn them, inside D5's own Magichange mode (char.dat magichange_weapon/magichange_type + magic.dat skill_group 10 + the learnset). No exe hook: the mode already exists.",
 "source": {
  "game": "Disgaea 4 Complete+ (PC EN)",
